---
const pageTitle = 'Flight Emissions Calculator — World Airport Database';
const pageDesc = 'Calculate CO₂ emissions for any flight route. Select aircraft type, compare per-passenger emissions, and see environmental impact data.';
const pageUrl = 'https://world-airport-database.com/tools/emissions-calculator/';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>{pageTitle}</title>
  <meta name="description" content={pageDesc}>
  <link rel="canonical" href={pageUrl}>
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:title" content={pageTitle}>
  <meta property="og:description" content={pageDesc}>
  <meta property="og:url" content={pageUrl}>
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="World Airport Database">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://world-airport-database.com/logo-icon.svg">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    body{font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;background:#F4F7FA;color:#202c39;line-height:1.6}
    :root{--primary:#2ca4dc;--navy:#0B1D3A;--border:#D4E0E8;--stripe:#F0F6FC}
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}
    .ah{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--navy),#142b4f);padding:36px 0;border-bottom:4px solid var(--primary)}
    .ah h1{color:#fff;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:6px}
    .ah .sub{color:#8899aa;font-size:14px}
    .card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin:20px 0;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
    .card h3{font-size:16px;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
    .input-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-bottom:16px}
    @media(max-width:600px){.input-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px}
    select{width:100%;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;border:2px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;font-family:inherit;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .15s}
    select:focus{border-color:var(--primary);outline:none}
    .swap-row{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:-8px 0}
    .swap-btn{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--primary);background:#fff;color:var(--primary);font-size:18px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:all .15s}
    .swap-btn:hover{background:var(--primary);color:#fff}
    .calc-btn{display:block;width:100%;padding:16px;background:var(--primary);color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;border:none;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:background .15s}
    .calc-btn:hover{background:#2390c2}
    .results{display:none;margin-top:20px}
    .results.show{display:block}
    .result-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:16px;margin:16px 0}
    .result-box{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0f9ff,#e0f2fe);border:1px solid #bae6fd;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;text-align:center}
    .result-box .value{font-size:32px;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary);display:block}
    .result-box .label{font-size:11px;color:#5A6B7F;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:4px}
    .result-box .sub{font-size:11px;color:#8899aa;margin-top:2px}
    .result-box.highlight{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--navy),#142b4f);border-color:var(--navy)}
    .result-box.highlight .value{color:#60a5fa}
    .result-box.highlight .label{color:#8899aa}
    .result-box.warning{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef3c7,#fde68a);border-color:#f59e0b}
    .result-box.warning .value{color:#d97706}
    .result-box.success{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d1fae5,#a7f3d0);border-color:#34d399}
    .result-box.success .value{color:#059669}
    .result-box.danger{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fee2e2,#fecaca);border-color:#ef4444}
    .result-box.danger .value{color:#dc2626}
    .route-info{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;font-size:14px;color:#5A6B7F;margin:12px 0}
    .route-info .airport{background:var(--stripe);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy)}
    .route-info .plane{font-size:20px}
    .quick-routes{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}
    .quick-btn{padding:6px 14px;background:var(--stripe);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:all .15s}
    .quick-btn:hover{border-color:var(--primary);background:#e3f0f7}
    .comparison-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;margin-top:12px}
    .comparison-table th{background:var(--stripe);padding:10px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#5A6B7F;border-bottom:2px solid var(--border)}
    .comparison-table td{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--navy)}
    .comparison-table tr:hover td{background:var(--stripe)}
    .comparison-table .highlight-row{background:#f0f9ff}
    .comparison-table .highlight-row td{font-weight:700;color:var(--primary)}
    .info-box{background:#f0f9ff;border:1px solid #bae6fd;border-radius:8px;padding:16px;font-size:13px;color:#5A6B7F;margin:16px 0;line-height:1.6}
    .info-box strong{color:var(--navy)}
    .info-box a{color:var(--primary)}
    .aircraft-cat{margin-bottom:4px;font-size:12px;color:#8899aa;font-style:italic;padding-left:4px}
    footer{background:var(--navy);color:#8899aa;padding:36px 0 24px;margin-top:40px;border-top:4px solid var(--primary);font-size:13px;text-align:center}
    footer a{color:var(--primary)}
  </style>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebApplication",
  "name": "Flight Emissions Calculator",
  "description": "{pageDesc}",
  "url": "{pageUrl}",
  "applicationCategory": "TravelApplication",
  "operatingSystem": "Web"
}
</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://world-airport-database.com/"},
    {"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Tools","item":"https://world-airport-database.com/tools/"},
    {"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Flight Emissions Calculator"}
  ]
}
</script>
</head>
<body>

<nav style="background:#0f172a;padding:10px 0;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100">
  <div class="wrap" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px">
    <a href="/" style="color:#fff;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none">World<span style="color:#60a5fa">Airport</span>DB</a>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <a href="/" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px">Home</a>
      <a href="/countries/" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px">Countries</a>
      <a href="/blog/" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px">Blog</a>
      <a href="/download/" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px">Database</a>
      <a href="/tools/iata-icao-lookup/" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px">Lookup</a>
      <a href="/tools/nearest-airport/" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px">Nearest</a>
      <a href="/tools/timezone-lookup/" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px">Timezone</a>
      <a href="/tools/airport-map/" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px">Map</a>
      <a href="/tools/emissions-calculator/" style="color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:700">Emissions</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="wrap" style="padding:12px 0;font-size:13px;color:#8899aa">
  <a href="/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none">Home</a> &rsaquo;
  <a href="/tools/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none">Tools</a> &rsaquo;
  <span style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Flight Emissions Calculator</span>
</div>

<div class="ah">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>🌿 Flight Emissions Calculator</h1>
    <div class="sub">Calculate the carbon footprint of any flight. Compare aircraft types, see per-passenger emissions, and understand your environmental impact.</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="card">
    <h3>✈️ Route & Aircraft</h3>
    <div class="input-row">
      <div>
        <label>From Airport</label>
        <select id="em-from">
          <option value="">Select departure airport...</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>To Airport</label>
        <select id="em-to">
          <option value="">Select arrival airport...</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="swap-row">
      <button class="swap-btn" onclick="swapAirports()" title="Swap airports">⇅</button>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-bottom:16px">
      <label>Aircraft Type</label>
      <select id="em-aircraft">
        <option value="">Select aircraft type...</option>
        <optgroup label="🛩️ Regional / Commuter">
          <option value="crj900">Bombardier CRJ-900 (90 seats)</option>
          <option value="e190">Embraer E190 (100 seats)</option>
          <option value="e195e2">Embraer E195-E2 (130 seats)</option>
          <option value="a220">Airbus A220-300 (130 seats)</option>
        </optgroup>
        <optgroup label="✈️ Narrow-Body / Single-Aisle">
          <option value="a319">Airbus A319 (140 seats)</option>
          <option value="a320" selected>Airbus A320 (180 seats)</option>
          <option value="a321">Airbus A321 (220 seats)</option>
          <option value="b737">Boeing 737-800 (175 seats)</option>
          <option value="b737max">Boeing 737 MAX 9 (180 seats)</option>
          <option value="b757">Boeing 757-200 (200 seats)</option>
          <option value="md80">McDonnell Douglas MD-80 (150 seats)</option>
        </optgroup>
        <optgroup label="🛫 Wide-Body / Twin-Aisle">
          <option value="b767">Boeing 767-300 (250 seats)</option>
          <option value="a330">Airbus A330-300 (300 seats)</option>
          <option value="b787">Boeing 787-9 Dreamliner (290 seats)</option>
          <option value="a350">Airbus A350-900 (330 seats)</option>
          <option value="b777">Boeing 777-300ER (350 seats)</option>
        </optgroup>
        <optgroup label="🛬 Jumbo / Very Large">
          <option value="b747">Boeing 747-400 (400 seats)</option>
          <option value="a380">Airbus A380 (500 seats)</option>
        </optgroup>
        <optgroup label="⚡ Supersonic">
          <option value="concorde">Concorde (100 seats)</option>
        </optgroup>
      </select>
    </div>
    <button class="calc-btn" onclick="calcEmissions()">Calculate Emissions</button>
    <div class="quick-routes">
      <span style="font-size:12px;color:#8899aa;margin-right:4px">Quick routes:</span>
      <button class="quick-btn" onclick="setRoute('LHR','JFK')">LHR → JFK</button>
      <button class="quick-btn" onclick="setRoute('FRA','LAX')">FRA → LAX</button>
      <button class="quick-btn" onclick="setRoute('LHR','SYD')">LHR → SYD</button>
      <button class="quick-btn" onclick="setRoute('CDG','DXB')">CDG → DXB</button>
      <button class="quick-btn" onclick="setRoute('SFO','HNL')">SFO → HNL</button>
      <button class="quick-btn" onclick="setRoute('FRA','VIE')">FRA → VIE</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="results" id="results">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>📊 Emissions Results</h3>
      <div class="route-info" id="route-info"></div>
      <div class="result-grid">
        <div class="result-box highlight">
          <span class="value" id="res-km">0</span>
          <span class="label">Flight Distance</span>
          <span class="sub">kilometers</span>
        </div>
        <div class="result-box danger">
          <span class="value" id="res-co2-total">0</span>
          <span class="label">Total CO₂</span>
          <span class="sub">kilograms</span>
        </div>
        <div class="result-box warning">
          <span class="value" id="res-co2-pax">0</span>
          <span class="label">CO₂ per Passenger</span>
          <span class="sub">kilograms</span>
        </div>
        <div class="result-box success">
          <span class="value" id="res-co2-km">0</span>
          <span class="label">CO₂ per km</span>
          <span class="sub">kg per km</span>
        </div>
        <div class="result-box">
          <span class="value" id="res-fuel">0</span>
          <span class="label">Jet Fuel Burned</span>
          <span class="sub">liters</span>
        </div>
        <div class="result-box">
          <span class="value" id="res-trees">0</span>
          <span class="label">Trees to Offset</span>
          <span class="sub">1 year of growth</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>🚗 Comparison: Same Route, Different Transport</h3>
      <p style="font-size:13px;color:#5A6B7F;margin-bottom:12px">How this flight compares to other modes of transport for the same distance.</p>
      <table class="comparison-table" id="comparison-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Mode</th>
            <th>CO₂ per Passenger</th>
            <th>vs. This Flight</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="comparison-body">
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="info-box">
        <strong>💡 Note:</strong> Emissions estimates are based on average occupancy rates and include only CO₂ (not contrails or other non-CO₂ effects). Rail and bus figures assume European averages. Actual values vary by route, operator, and load factor.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>📖 About Flight Emissions</h3>
      <div class="info-box">
        <p><strong>How is this calculated?</strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">The calculator uses the great-circle distance between airports and aircraft-specific fuel burn rates. Jet fuel combustion produces approximately <strong>2.52 kg CO₂ per liter</strong> of fuel burned. The total CO₂ is then divided by typical seat count to give per-passenger figures.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px"><strong>Important:</strong> Actual emissions can be 20-40% higher due to:</p>
        <ul style="margin:6px 0 0 20px;padding:0">
          <li>Non-CO₂ effects (contrails, NOₓ, soot) at altitude</li>
          <li>Extra fuel for taxi, takeoff, climb, and holding patterns</li>
          <li>Headwinds and routing inefficiencies</li>
          <li>Cargo weight and lower-than-full passenger loads</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">The <strong>RFI (Radiative Forcing Index)</strong> multiplier of ~1.9-2.0 is often applied to account for non-CO₂ effects, meaning the <em>total climate impact</em> is roughly double the CO₂ alone.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <a href="/" style="display:inline-block;margin:20px 0;color:var(--primary);font-weight:600;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none">&larr; Back to World Airport Database</a>
</div>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div><strong>World Airport Database since 2008</strong> — based on open data from <a href="https://ourairports.com/" target="_blank">OurAirports</a></div>
    <div style="margin-top:8px">Not affiliated with IATA or ICAO.</div>
    <div style="margin-top:10px"><a href="/impressum/">Impressum</a></div>
  </div>
</footer>

